OL,3,CIsrael rejects Trump's Gaza peace
OL,4,Cplan, saying no withdrawal until Hamas
OL,5,Cdisarms
OL,7,FIsraeli Prime Minister Benjamin
OL,8,FNetanyahu says his country has
OL,9,Frejected the latest US-backed peace
OL,10,Fplan for Gaza, demanding the full
OL,11,Fdisarmament of Hamas before any
OL,12,FIsraeli forces withdraw.
OL,14,FThe comments come more than a week
OL,15,Fafter US President Donald Trump
OL,16,Fannounced a breakthrough in
OL,17,Fnegotiations, with his Board of Peace
OL,18,Fissuing a new 15-point plan aimed at
OL,19,Fsecuring lasting peace in the
OL,20,Fterritory.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
