FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786322871
OL,3,CIsrael rejects Trump's Gaza peace
OL,4,Cplan, saying no withdrawal until Hamas
OL,5,Cdisarms
OL,7,FBut in his first comments directly
OL,8,Faddressing the plan, Netanyahu said:
OL,9,F"I want to be precise here: Israel
OL,10,Frejects the 15-point document."
OL,12,FHe said the Israeli military would
OL,13,F"not withdraw at all until Hamas is
OL,14,Fgenuinely disarmed and will continue
OL,15,Fto thwart threats against our forces
OL,16,Fand citizens".
