OL,3,CIsrael rejects Trump's Gaza peace
OL,4,Cplan, saying no withdrawal until Hamas
OL,5,Cdisarms
OL,7,F"We are now discussing this with the
OL,8,FAmericans," he added. "They have
OL,9,Fideas, some of which are acceptable to
OL,10,Fus and some are not, and we know how
OL,11,Fto stand up to those things.
OL,13,F"As long as I am prime minister, no
OL,14,FPalestinian state will be established
OL,15,F` not in Gaza and not in the West
OL,16,FBank," Netanyahu said.
OL,18,FNetanyahu's right-wing coalition faces
OL,19,Fan election at the end of October and
OL,20,Fis trailing in opinion polls.
