OL,3,CIsrael rejects Trump's Gaza peace
OL,4,Cplan, saying no withdrawal until Hamas
OL,5,Cdisarms
OL,7,FReferring to Israeli military action
OL,8,Fin Gaza and Lebanon, as well as
OL,9,Fstrikes in Iran earlier this year,
OL,10,FNetanyahu added: "Contrary to all
OL,11,Fthose who preach to us, we do what
OL,12,Fmust be done for Israel's security and
OL,13,Fwe can and will stand our ground even
OL,14,Fagainst our best friends when
OL,15,Fnecessary."
