OL,3,CIsrael rejects Trump's Gaza peace
OL,4,Cplan, saying no withdrawal until Hamas
OL,5,Cdisarms
OL,7,FAt the end of July, Trump announced
OL,8,Fwhat he described as a historic
OL,9,Fagreement to secure the disarmament of
OL,10,FHamas and all other armed groups in
OL,11,FGaza, months after the president first
OL,12,Fannounced a US-brokered ceasefire
OL,13,Fagreement between Hamas and Israel.
OL,15,FHamas said it would only go through
OL,16,Fwith the deal if Israel halts strikes
OL,17,Fin Gaza and pulls troops back to the
OL,18,F"yellow line," as defined by the
OL,19,FOctober ceasefire agreement.
OL,26,@zD@AOUzD@NO]
