OL,3,CIsrael rejects Trump's Gaza peace
OL,4,Cplan, saying no withdrawal until Hamas
OL,5,Cdisarms
OL,7,FOn Sunday, a senior official of the
OL,8,Fgroup said it remained committed to
OL,9,Fthe roadmap set out by Trump's Peace
OL,10,FCouncil.
OL,12,F"We expect the mediators and the
OL,13,FAmerican guarantor to pressure
OL,14,FNetanyahu and his government to adhere
OL,15,Fto the roadmap and not obstruct the
OL,16,Fprocess for internal political and
OL,17,Felectoral reasons" said Bassem Naim, a
OL,18,Fmember of Hamas' politburo on X.
OL,26,@tD@AOUyD@RO]
