OL,3,CIsrael rejects Trump's Gaza peace
OL,4,Cplan, saying no withdrawal until Hamas
OL,5,Cdisarms
OL,7,FIsraeli forces currently occupy more
OL,8,Fthan half of Gaza, in the east and
OL,9,Fsouth of the territory and senior
OL,10,Fministers have signaled they want to
OL,11,Fexpand control.
OL,13,FHouthis claim attacks on Saudi Arabian
OL,14,Foil facility and Yemini port
OL,16,FElsewhere in the Middle East, Yemen's
OL,17,FIran-backed Houthi rebels attacked a
OL,18,Fcrucial port on the Red Sea.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/11
