OL,3,CIsrael rejects Trump's Gaza peace
OL,4,Cplan, saying no withdrawal until Hamas
OL,5,Cdisarms
OL,7,FFayed al-Noman, assistant
OL,8,Fundersecretary of the information
OL,9,Fministry, said the Houthis fired
OL,10,Fmissiles and drones on the port,
OL,11,Fseverely damaging its buildings and
OL,12,Fpier as well as commercial goods and
OL,13,Ffood supplies at the facility.
OL,15,FThe National Resistance Forces, a
OL,16,FYemeni government-allied force, said
OL,17,Fat least seven people ` four troops
OL,18,Fand three civilians ` were killed and
OL,19,F15 civilians were injured in Sunday's
OL,20,Fattack on Mokha port.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/11
