OL,3,CIsrael rejects Trump's Gaza peace
OL,4,Cplan, saying no withdrawal until Hamas
OL,5,Cdisarms
OL,7,FMokha is one of the main ports under
OL,8,FYemen's internationally recognised
OL,9,Fgovernment, renovated in recent years
OL,10,Fto handle shipping that avoids the
OL,11,FHouthi-held ports in Hodeida.
OL,13,FThe Houthis later claimed the attack,
OL,14,Fsaying they fired "a large number of
OL,15,Fballistic missiles and drones" that
OL,16,Ftargeted military enforcement and
OL,17,Fwarehouses in the area.
