OL,7,FYahya Saree, a military spokesperson
OL,8,Ffor the Houthis, said they also
OL,9,Ftargeted an Aramco refinery in the
OL,10,FSaudi Arabian city of Jazan with a
OL,11,Fdrone.
OL,13,FThe attack was in response to Saudi
OL,14,Fdrones' breaching Yemen's airspace
OL,15,Fover the provinces of Hajjah and
OL,16,FSaada, he said.
